---
import EditPage from '../components/EditPage.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<EditPage
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy"
    lead="How Peptide Connect handles data. In Phase C this becomes the full policy and is finalized by the owner."
      >
        <p>
         Peptide Connect is committed to PII minimization. In a live phase,
          requests collect the minimum required to route and confirm an inquiry,
           access is server-authenticated, and data is retained only as long as
            needed.
             </p>
        <p>
         In this DEMO build, <strong>no personal data is collected or transmitted</strong>.
          Form submissions are handled locally in the browser and discarded; nothing
           reaches a server.
            </p>
                 <p class="muted">Last reviewed: DEMO · entity: {site.legal.entity}.</p>
    </EditPage>
